n for Standardization (<a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/39965.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/39965.html</a>).</p><p class="Biblio"><a name="iso-19115-2003-2" id="iso-19115-2003-2"></a>[7]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO&#xA0;19115:2003: Geographic information&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;Metadata, International Organization for Standardization, committee, International Organization for Standardization (<a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/26020.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/26020.html</a>).</p><p class="Biblio"><a name="iso-19136-2007" id="iso-19136-2007"></a>[8]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO&#xA0;19136:2007: Geographic information&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;Geography Markup Language (GML), International Organization for Standardization, committee, International Organization for Standardization (<a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/32554.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/32554.html</a>).</p><p class="Biblio"><a name="iso-19152-2012-2" id="iso-19152-2012-2"></a>[9]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ISO&#xA0;19152:2012: Geographic information&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;Land Administration Domain Model (LADM), International Organization for Standardization, committee, International Organization for Standardization (<a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/51206.html">https://www.iso.org/standard/51206.html</a>).</p><p class="Biblio"><a name="nima-technical-report-tr8350-2-department-of" id="nima-technical-report-tr8350-2-department-of"></a>[10]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Defense World Geodetic System 1984, Its Definition and Relationships with Local Geodetic Systems, Third Edition, National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency</p><p class="Biblio"><a name="wc3-extensible-markup-language-xml-https-www-w3-org-xml" id="wc3-extensible-markup-language-xml-https-www-w3-org-xml"></a>[11]<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>[NO INFORMATION AVAILABLE]</p>











</div>
